{"modelInput":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"text":"Summarise cloud computing in 2 bullet points."}]}],"inferenceConfig":{"maxTokens":200}},"modelOutput":{"output":{"message":{"content":[{"text":"- **On-demand Resource Availability**: Cloud computing provides scalable and on-demand access to a shared pool of computing resources such as servers, storage, networks, software, and databases over the internet, allowing users to access and use these resources as needed without requiring extensive local infrastructure.\n\n- **Pay-as-You-Go Pricing Model**: Cloud services are typically priced based on usage, allowing organizations to pay only for the resources they consume, thereby optimizing costs and eliminating the need for large upfront investments in hardware and software."}],"role":"assistant"}},"stopReason":"end_turn","usage":{"inputTokens":10,"outputTokens":105,"totalTokens":115}},"recordId":"071"}
